      "label": "Leadership Engagement",
      "quote": "He went round every department first, and even spent an afternoon standing at our front desk, helping us check guests in and answer the phone, and asking how many people were on the night shift and what time they handed over."
    },
    {
      "label": "Recognition and Appreciation",
      "quote": "He left a message on the whiteboard at the front desk. It said: thank you for all your hard work, front-desk colleagues."
    },
