      "label": "Employee Morale Improvement",
      "quote": "Before the first all-staff meeting, HR sent out a notice: pay rises for all staff, with frontline positions getting the biggest increases. My front-desk colleagues read that notice over and over in the back office, and the young woman on the night shift even phoned home."
    },
    {
      "label": "Humor and Relatability",
      "quote": "he said, hello everyone, I’m the new one here, and I’ve mainly come today to give you all a raise... in knowledge. The whole room laughed."
    },
    {
      "label": "Open Communication Channels",
      "quote": "he’d read every single one. After the meeting, when those of us on the front desk talk about it, we still imitate him saying ‘a raise in knowledge’"
    }
  ],
  "interpretation": "The interviewee highlights how the new deputy general manager's hands-on engagement, recognition of frontline staff, and open communication significantly improved morale and fostered a positive work environment.",
  "tone": "positive",
